flowchart TD
    input[Quick Paste, raw RFC822, or .eml] --> bounds[Request and parser bounds]
    bounds --> parse[Parse as data in memory]
    parse --> evidence[Headers, body text, URLs, attachment metadata]
    evidence --> rule[Rule analysis]
    evidence --> infer[Optional local ML inference]
    rule --> fuse[Decision and explanation fusion]
    infer --> fuse
    fuse --> response[Typed response with freshness and completeness]
    response --> ui[Frontend result, recommendations, optional local summary]
    bounds --> log[Privacy-safe request event]
    response --> log
